@node documenta-commands
@section (documenta commands)
This module provides the following interface.


@c %start of fragment

@subsection Procedures
@deffn Procedure build directory #:opt destination
Build the API documentation for the library in the given directory.

DIRECTORY (string) Absolute or relative path to a directory containing a
Guile Scheme library.

DESTINATION (string) Optional path to a directory where the
documentation should be saved.  If not provided, the documentation will
be saved in the current working directory, in a subdirectory defined by
the constant DEFAULT_DOC_PATH.

RESULT The API documentation is saved to the DESTINATION directory.

@end deffn


