@node documenta-writer
@section (documenta writer)
This module provides the following interface.


@c %start of fragment

@subsection Procedures
@deffn Procedure save text path
Write TEXT to the file in PATH.

TEXT (string) Arbitrary text.

PATH (string) Absolute or relative path to the file the text will be
written to.

RESULT If the file doesn't exist, it will be created and the text will
be saved to it.  If the file exists, its contents will be overwritten.

@end deffn


